{"id":"wb-6-235","name":"栗毓美墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"栗毓美墓","text":"栗毓美墓位于中国山西省浑源县城东北，是清代大臣栗毓美的墓，俗称栗家坟，1965年被列为山西省文物保护单位，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n栗毓美墓坐北朝南，由南至北有砖碹大门、汉白玉牌坊和华表、墓道和石像生、坟茔。牌坊旁有碑亭，碑文为林则徐撰写。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A0%97%E6%AF%93%E7%BE%8E%E5%A2%93","revisionId":85382502,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85382502","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e6015194261e311e4907d330.jpg","title":"Hunyuan_Li_Yumei_Mu_2013.08.30_11-01-00.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hunyuan_Li_Yumei_Mu_2013.08.30_11-01-00.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/Hunyuan_Li_Yumei_Mu_2013.08.30_11-01-00.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"浑源栗毓美墓——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}